    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Domain</strong> is a time survival game with over-the-top action gameplay and Roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is survive until death eventually puts an end to your journey to the Divine Domain. Earn gold in each run and purchase upgrades to make your next run easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral, Expressive Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons alongside a lot of <strong>powerful abilities</strong>\u00a0as you battle Gods and Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Unbreakable</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Upgrades mean you are always making progress on your journey to the Divine Domain</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way. With fully customizable bindings for mouse and keyboard and controller support, fine-tune each action to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Hack and Slash Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Run is Completely Unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always Progress using permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Domain</strong> is a time survival game with over-the-top action gameplay and Roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is survive until death eventually puts an end to your journey to the Divine Domain. Earn gold in each run and purchase upgrades to make your next run easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral, Expressive Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons alongside a lot of <strong>powerful abilities</strong>\u00a0as you battle Gods and Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Unbreakable</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Upgrades mean you are always making progress on your journey to the Divine Domain</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way. With fully customizable bindings for mouse and keyboard and controller support, fine-tune each action to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Hack and Slash Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Run is Completely Unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always Progress using permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
